<div class="tabbed-contents">
<div class="exclude-units" id="tab-bis-lists-pre-raid-opening" role="tabpanel" style="" tabindex="0">This list represents the best gear available in Mists of Pandaria Classic prior to Mogu'Shan Vaults opening and Celestial Dungeons becoming available. <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=74724/enchant-weapon-jade-spirit">
<img alt="Enchant Weapon - Jade Spirit" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_enchantedscroll.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Weapon - Jade Spirit</span></a> and <a class="q1 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=74703/enchant-bracer-super-intellect">
<img alt="Enchant Bracer - Super Intellect" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_enchantedscroll.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Bracer - Super Intellect</span></a> require high reputation grinds and are unlikely to be available this early on, so use <a class="q1 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=74700/enchant-bracer-mastery">
<img alt="Enchant Bracer - Mastery" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_enchantedscroll.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Bracer - Mastery</span></a> and <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=74723/enchant-weapon-windsong">
<img alt="Enchant Weapon - Windsong" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_enchantedscroll.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Weapon - Windsong</span></a> instead.<br/>
<br/>
