<div class="exclude-units" id="tab-bis-lists-hof-release" role="tabpanel" style="display: none;" tabindex="0">The list below contains the best overall gear available from the second wave of Celestial Dungeons in Mists of Pandaria Classic Phase 1. Once <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/zone=6297/heart-of-fear">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Heart of Fear</span></a> is out, we will be able to buy 483 pieces from the Celestial Vendor, including three tier pieces. <br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=86865/kritak-imperial-scepter-of-the-swarm">
<img alt="Kri'tak, Imperial Scepter of the Swarm" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_mace_1h_pandaraid_d_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Kri'tak, Imperial Scepter of the Swarm</span></a> is a strong weapon option that is unlocked at this stage and which can eventually be socketed with the powerful <a class="q5 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=89882/crystallized-horror">
<img alt="Crystallized Horror" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_legendary_breathofblackprince_str.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Crystallized Horror</span></a> gem if you are still using it in later patches, making it even stronger!<br/>
<br/>
