<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="world-drops">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c7" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/expansionicon_mistsofpandaria.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Best World Drop Items for Restoration Shamans</span></h2>Mists of Pandaria brings with it a whole lot of world content with the chance to get powerful gear. This will be from World Bosses such as <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/npc=60491/sha-of-anger">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Sha of Anger</span></a> and <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/npc=62346/galleon">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Galleon</span></a>.<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="galleon-warbands">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c7" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_mushanbeastmount.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Galleon and Salyis' Warband</span></h3>Galleon is a World Boss that has a chance to reward those who kill him with item level 496 loot. As a Restoration Shaman, there are 8 different items we want.<ul class="exclude-units">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90452/sparkmaker-girdle">
<img alt="Sparkmaker Girdle" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_mail_raidshaman_l_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sparkmaker Girdle</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90422/armor-of-the-single-cloud">
<img alt="Armor of the Single Cloud" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_mail_raidshaman_l_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Armor of the Single Cloud</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90443/burnmender-boots">
<img alt="Burnmender Boots" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_mail_raidshaman_l_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Burnmender Boots</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90412/helm-of-restoring-wind">
<img alt="Helm of Restoring Wind" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helm_mail_raidshaman_l_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Helm of Restoring Wind</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90434/steaming-seal-of-flame">
<img alt="Steaming Seal of Flame" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_150.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Steaming Seal of Flame</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90430/stomphowl-pendant">
<img alt="Stomphowl Pendant" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_108.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Stomphowl Pendant</span></a></div></li></ul>
<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="world-drops-2">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c7" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_jewelry_trinketpvp_02.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> PvP and BoE World Drops</span></h2>While not necessary, using some PvP gear is helpful for early gearing given that you can buy exactly the slots you need for <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/currency=390/conquest-points">
<span>
<img alt="Conquest Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvpcurrency-conquest-horde.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Conquest Points</span></span></a> before raids are even out. There are also some very powerful bind on equip epics which are sure to be extremely expensive but also good options for early min maxers, and we give examples of the best of both below.<ul class="exclude-units">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=84888/malevolent-gladiators-pendant-of-meditation">
<img alt="Malevolent Gladiator's Pendant of Meditation" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_pvp_neck_a3.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Malevolent Gladiator's Pendant of Meditation</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=84825/malevolent-gladiators-band-of-meditation">
<img alt="Malevolent Gladiator's Band of Meditation" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_pvp_ringc3.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Malevolent Gladiator's Band of Meditation</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=84984/malevolent-gladiators-armbands-of-meditation">
