<img alt="Treads of Edward the Odd" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_mail_raidshaman_l_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Treads of Edward the Odd</span></a></div></li></ul>
<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="sha-of-anger">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c7" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/sha_spell_fire_felfirenova.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Sha of Anger</span></h3>Sha of Anger is notable in that it drops item level 496 Tier 14 Legs and Gloves, as well as various item level 483 Malevolent Gladiator's pieces. This is a great way to get a headstart on your Tier set if you get lucky. <br/>
<br/>The first time you kill the Sha of Anger, it will also drop <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=89317/claw-of-anger">
<img alt="Claw of Anger" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_hand_1h_shaclaw.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Claw of Anger</span></a>. This can be turned in for <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90907/boots-of-unbreakable-umbrage">
<img alt="Boots of Unbreakable Umbrage" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boot_mail_reputation_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Boots of Unbreakable Umbrage</span></a>, a decent pair of early Boots.<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="reputation">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c7" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/achievement_faction_shadopan_assault.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Best Reputation Items for Restoration Shamans</span></h2>Reputation gear can be very strong, but it can also be difficult to choose which factions to prioritize first. As a Restoration Shaman, we want to prioritize <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/faction=1270/shado-pan">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Shado-Pan</span></a> to get our hands on <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=89078/sagewhispers-wrap">
<img alt="Sagewhisper's Wrap" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_cape_pandaria_c_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sagewhisper's Wrap</span></a> at <span class="rep-honored">Honored</span> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=89296/nightwatchers-helm">
<img alt="Nightwatcher's Helm" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helm_mail_reputation_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Nightwatcher's Helm</span></a> at <span class="rep-revered">Revered</span>. The most important thing to consider is your current gear and where you have weak slots.<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="the-klaxxi">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c7" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
